{
"file": 34,
"paths": [
"d002/f647"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "4128651d",
"en_raw": "A huge swarm of snakes in Tsukazato Forest?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "9619afc0",
"en_raw": "Who did you hear that tall tale from?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "0b0d97c4",
"en_raw": "It's not a tall tale"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "ef6caa1d",
"en_raw": "Segawa said it's true"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "d4dce468",
"en_raw": "Shinta Segawa?"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "8c552936",
"en_raw": "That coward, right?"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "3a20d24b",
"en_raw": "He probably mistook"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "3a3bfd25",
"en_raw": "a cord for a snake"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "82024481",
"en_raw": "But class rep"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "1a7b4d3b",
"en_raw": "Yamazaki saw them too"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "8cefc636",
"en_raw": "What, that stiff guy?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "1bedd239",
"en_raw": "Yeah, really"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "48aec793",
"en_raw": "as if it was perfectly normal"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "e1b9e48f",
"en_raw": "He said there were over 100..."
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "eb42d2da",
"en_raw": "In those woods?"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "69342961",
"en_raw": "No way there are any"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "ec83aed4",
"en_raw": "But if there were"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "ea50a1fd",
"en_raw": "wouldn't you want to see?"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "84489898",
"en_raw": "Nao, you shouldn't"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "60c46dd1",
"en_raw": "say things so carelessly"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "c4df8268",
"en_raw": "Why?"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "e53cc772",
"en_raw": "Because, you know"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "a4630282",
"en_raw": "in a forest that isn't a zoo"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "e98b5864",
"en_raw": "countless black and yellow striped snakes"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "f76c26e4",
"en_raw": "are slithering around"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "a6a36d75",
"en_raw": "in the mud, slimy and writhing"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "0264d2de",
"en_raw": "all over"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "dcc2ebc7",
"en_raw": "Maybe even coiled around"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "2680428b",
"en_raw": "a human skull..."
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "c0622e4a",
"en_raw": "...Maybe we should stop"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "5f59e350",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants to see!"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "de6049c7",
"en_raw": "There are several paths into the forest"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "cb822587",
"en_raw": "but from Tsukazato Inari"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "8995427a",
"en_raw": "on the way to the reservoir, maybe..."
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "2e0fb684",
"en_raw": "Looks like a long walk today"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "e631a690",
"en_raw": "...Melos, be happy!"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "2447d2ed",
"en_raw": "Still,"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "a706dd74",
"en_raw": "that was a terrible pile of garbage"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "54e68a71",
"en_raw": "If a little trash gets dumped somewhere"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "524eea60",
"en_raw": "it's a dump already"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "6f2fb99e",
"en_raw": "Before you know it"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "c21be341",
"en_raw": "everyone starts dumping"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "7595cf9f",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants to see snakes!"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "d567b4e5",
"en_raw": "Nao, snakes, snakes"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "5abe3758",
"en_raw": "They're definitely there"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "bd56b695",
"en_raw": "Is that trail really a snake's?"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "a20cb16b",
"en_raw": "Come to think of it, Nao"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "1f5c4620",
"en_raw": "have you ever seen a real snake?"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "a001bc13",
"en_raw": "No, have you, Sango?"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "0244ec5f",
"en_raw": "...I've seen a Tsuchinoko"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "ec89a816",
"en_raw": "Is that a snake?"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "247ae1bf",
"en_raw": "Yeah"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "514a3f9a",
"en_raw": "It's like the boss of snakes"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "cd089c35",
"en_raw": "Its mouth is about 3 m wide"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "b5b5f9f5",
"en_raw": "and it lives in Hokkaido"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "c1f80c7c",
"en_raw": "It swallows bears whole"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "fa8c353f",
"en_raw": "so its belly is round"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "82570746",
"en_raw": "Right, and its fangs are venomous"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "66129dcc",
"en_raw": "Enough venom to kill"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "f3461a1e",
"en_raw": "ten African elephants"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "29900e0a",
"en_raw": "When did you see that?"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "c63dcbf2",
"en_raw": "In elementary school"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "c38d3632",
"en_raw": "But can you say for sure"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "7e3ee007",
"en_raw": "it wasn't a dragged hose mark?"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "24cf05da",
"en_raw": "get it at all"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "cb9404b6",
"en_raw": "Let's search a bit more"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "fdcddbec",
"en_raw": "Yeah, it's a small thicket anyway"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "398c975e",
"en_raw": "I'll sit this one out"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "45781adb",
"en_raw": "That cave is really"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "1756a33e",
"en_raw": "bothering me"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "1767eebb",
"en_raw": "but I don't have the nerve to go in"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "3e3b830c",
"en_raw": "...It's definitely dangerous"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "bbc13271",
"en_raw": "Then Kurumi will go"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "4eba1a2e",
"en_raw": "Lots of shed skins in the cave"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "2a96ed1a",
"en_raw": "...which means"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "907f9479",
"en_raw": "they're really there"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "aec002cf",
"en_raw": "Somewhere in the forest, a swarm of snakes"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "decb69ef",
"en_raw": "...What Segawa said"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "49097e97",
"en_raw": "wasn't a lie, was it?"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "e0362118",
"en_raw": "I'm getting chills"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "94aef95a",
"en_raw": "Can I go home?"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "ef078cf8",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sango"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "1465925e",
"en_raw": "When we were in elementary school"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "883f0a66",
"en_raw": "was the forest that small?"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "4a65da5e",
"en_raw": "I don't remember"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "1f7c79ee",
"en_raw": "And it's awful"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "189cceae",
"en_raw": "that pile of garbage"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "40747f13",
"en_raw": "Even cockroaches would flee"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "31572152",
"en_raw": "Oh yeah, Kurumi knows!"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "bdbdf3f4",
"en_raw": "Bugs, snakes"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "139d6a5e",
"en_raw": "oh no, oh no"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "c124cf9e",
"en_raw": "we have to move house"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "ae00e42b",
"en_raw": "...Oh no?"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "bdbdf3f4",
"en_raw": "Bugs, snakes"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "e2e3b4ac",
"en_raw": "You notice trouble right away"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "86d7ee60",
"en_raw": "but Kurumi forgets right away"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "47ad28ee",
"en_raw": "and goes to sleep"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "aceb34b8",
"en_raw": "I get what Shiina's saying"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "2ff72ddc",
"en_raw": "...The most oblivious ones"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "17b99a14",
"en_raw": "are humans, after all, right?"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "a536e815",
"en_raw": "Aren't you human too, Sango?"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "f0397a1f",
"en_raw": "I don't care"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "505c3d82",
"en_raw": "what happens to the future"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "a32e1e51",
"en_raw": "That's irresponsible... I won't do that"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "b84481e7",
"en_raw": "If saying 'I don't want to'"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "d7d0b395",
"en_raw": "could fix things"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "7b8b0c4d",
"en_raw": "life would be easy, Nao"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "d3a4ad5a",
"en_raw": "I'll clean up the garbage"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "5eb24134",
"en_raw": "...starting tomorrow"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "f5b3d5c8",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Snake Place"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "33e266d1",
"en_raw": "I wonder if the snakes are gone"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "19bd8224",
"en_raw": "Even if they are"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "66966fe3",
"en_raw": "it's no problem, right?"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "7fe27d59",
"en_raw": "True, but..."
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "f57bf608",
"en_raw": "By the way, Nao"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "9c6cad44",
"en_raw": "are you cleaning up the garbage?"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}